  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_297680_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures-fabric\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_585782_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/additional-structures?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/297680(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"500\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"裝飾線\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 說明\n\n此模組為遊戲新增約 250 種小型與中型結構，讓你的世界更加豐富！\n\n- 支援生態系生成模組，例如 Terralith、Traverse、Biomes O' Plenty、Biome Bundle 等！\n- 整合 Mystcraft（MC 1.12）\n- 提供設定選項，可調整各類結構的生成數值！（MC 1.12）\n- 可配合 `/locate` 指令使用\n- 內建更新檢查器\n- 不同的結構會在主世界與終界的原版及模組生態系中生成！\n- [設定用數據包](https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack)\n\n想要在 1.18+ 版本修改或調整某些結構數值嗎？[點擊這裡查看教學！](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack)\n\n[點擊這裡可查看當前版本的所有結構](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/structures)！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"裝飾線\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 預覽\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/HJ3k534.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/BcQcqeI.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/mYWKb79.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/U20qUIY.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/kqG38d8.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/wDwNNl4.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/ZuLeZyF.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/Eevyyo9.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/aIJVHLA.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/7KLxZrl.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/8YVKUi0.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/bbZ7yxe.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/sGMDPw4.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/Ta7WuIM.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"裝飾線\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 🗃️ 相依模組\n\n### 必要：\n- **Magma Core** [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n    - 提供基礎程式碼與功能，例如更新檢查器\n    - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n### 支援：\n- **Mystcraft** [MC 1.12]\n    - 新增 AS 結構的功能圖示\n    - [CurseForge][cf_mc] | [Modrinth][mr_mc]\n- **Antique Atlas** [≥ MC 1.21]\n    - 在地圖上顯示部分結構的標記\n    - [CurseForge][cf_aa] | [Modrinth][mr_aa]\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"裝飾線\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 我的其他模組！\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"額外結構\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"基岩礦工\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"工具升級\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"全相容性\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"自訂地牢戰利品\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"進階木棍\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"武器紀元\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"符文工藝\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"收集品\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"額外寶石\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"礦坑陷阱\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"外骨骼工藝\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"城市工藝\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"循環再造\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"詞彙典\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"核心戰鬥模式\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"方塊偵探\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑花盆\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"裝飾線\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"訊息\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi